The furthest I have ever been was at the bottom of Gnome mines. I was
playing as an Orc barbarian, got to the Castle and figured "what the
hell" and went for the end.

Couple of hard parts, like some of the zoos filled with horrible
monsters and the plane of air was easily one of the hardest parts of
the entire game. The Wizard and the "Force" that dropped me back about
15 times was...annoying.

It was outweighed by my huge luck with wishs and genocides, thrones
were nice to me and I got GDSM quickly. at the end I had pretty low
max HP thanks to some fire traps, low enchantments but, dispite some
chaos where I got cornered by all three riders at one point, I fought
my way to the altar and ascended. I'll post my data when I get home.

It was fun, now I'm never playing again.


